<title>UK: Suedwest LB sets 300 billion lire 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Suedwest LB sets 300 billion lire 10-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BNP, BCI and San Paolo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWEST LB</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.50 PCT  MATURITY    06.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.82    PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>(CORRECTS LISTING FROM LUX)</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	BEAR STEARNS IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
